# Terminal (Windows / PowerShell)

- **Chain with `;`** -- not `&&` (invalid in older PowerShell)
- **Quote paths** with spaces; prefer absolute paths in scripts
- **Remove dirs:** `Remove-Item -Recurse` (not `rmdir /s`)
- **Scripts blocked:** `Set-ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned -Scope CurrentUser` or `cmd /c …`

```powershell
cd "c:\project"; git status
```
